 * Render one nested list to its lines: `<ul>`, one entry per item, `</ul>`.
 * @param {readonly {text: string, items: object[]}[]} items - the list's items.
 * @param {Map<string, {url: string, source: string}>} definitions - the link definitions in force.
 * @returns {string[]} the list's lines.
 */
